        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "1660-80, French; Pink silk satin, embroidered with gimp"@en , "Fragment of embroidery made of pink silk satin, couched with silk cord and partially wrapped silver filé, parchment ‘leaves’ wrapped in pink silk floss and silk-wrapped purl, and embroidered with white and yellow silk floss. These are worked in French knots and satin stitch in a pattern of scrolling vines and flowers."@en ;
